(text "J23 E-stop feed -> LM74700-Q1 ideal diode + BSC070N10NS5 (reverse battery to\n-65 V) -> VBAT_ESTOP_PRE: E-stop status sense (R251 -> U34), trip driver bias\n(R400). Rail cut TPS48100 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 + 2 mOhm (trip 15.8/20/24.8 A)\nenabled by WD_OK AND ESTOP_OK -> VBAT_ESTOP: engine slot (fuel/crank/glow) and\nADC readback R411. Replaces Q70/Q71 SQD40P10-40L, D137, R627." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 203.2 173.99 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "816d1a26-af35-4483-85c4-ab469400d02d"))
